EXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, Sequences, TLC
CONSTANTS NULL
CONSTANTS NOW, anomalies, verifications
VARIABLES state
Inv1 == \A r_1 \in verifications : r_1.score >= 0.0 /\ r_1.score <= 1.0
Inv2 == \A r_2 \in verifications : r_2.liveness_score >= 0.0 /\ r_2.liveness_score <= 1.0
Inv3 == \A r_3 \in verifications : r_3.fap60_result /= NULL => r_3.fap60_genuine = TRUE
Inv4 == \A anomaly_4 \in anomalies : anomaly_4.detected_at <= NOW
Inv5 == \A anomaly_5 \in anomalies : anomaly_5.confidence >= 0.0

